> linked, not stripped
> 
> My question is how to create a ELF class 64-bit S.so, which is required
> by Splus 6.0 under SunOS.

You probably need to edit SHOME/library/S_FLAGS and
SHOME/cmd/LIBRARY_FLAGS and add -xarch=v9 to CC, CXX and FC.  That should 
ensure you get 64-bit builds: check each line executed with cc does 
include -xarch=v9.

