-------------------------------
- Prof. Terrence L. Fine, Cornell University, USA (banquet speaker): Theories of
  probability: some questions about foundations.
- Prof. Irving J. Good, Virginia Tech., USA: title will be available soon.
- Prof. Patrick Suppes, Stanford University, USA: Application of nonmonotonic 
upper
  probabilities to quantum entanglement.
(http://www.sipta.org/~isipta03/invited.html)

The papers
----------
The 44 papers accepted for publication in the ISIPTA '03 proceedings have gone 
through
a careful reviewing and selection process to the extent of doing proceedings 
meeting
the highest standards.
(http://www.sipta.org/~isipta03/accepted.html).

