From fharrell at virginia.edu  Thu May 22 19:28:50 2003
From: fharrell at virginia.edu (Frank E Harrell Jr)
Date: Thu, 22 May 2003 15:28:50 -0400
Subject: Re: treating co-variates that do not obey the ordinality
In-Reply-To: <01C32077.801C9620.psendi@uhbs.ch>
References: <01C32077.801C9620.psendi@uhbs.ch>
Message-ID: <20030522152850.19969661.fharrell@virginia.edu>

On Thu, 22 May 2003 15:33:30 +0200
Pedram Sendi <psendi at uhbs.ch> wrote:

> Dear All
> 
> I am analysing the effect of a stable partnership (p.stable) adjusted for 
> other co-variates on the ability to work (abilityrr) in HIV infected 
> patients. Abilityrr has three ordinal categories (0,1,2) and I am modeling 
